OL,3,ACyber attack on police force may have
OL,4,A'compromised' staff information
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyber attack on a police force in
OL,7,FWales may have resulted in staff
OL,8,Finformation being "accessed or
OL,9,Fcompromised".
OL,11,FDyfed-Powys Police said the hack had
OL,12,Fcaused disruption to some non-emergency
OL,13,Fsystems but no personal data relating
OL,14,Fto members of the public was believed
OL,15,Fto have been accessed.
OL,17,FThe force said the incident was
OL,18,Fidentified on 14 September, and an
OL,19,Finvestigation is under way.
OL,21,FThe Information Commissioner's Office
OL,22,F(ICO) has been notified.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
